      "reason": "--only-segmentsに含まれないため生成しません",
      "canonical_text": "Today's topic is “Can’t Wait for the Next Episode”? Make One Yourself? “byUs” Lets You Make Stories with Characters You Love."
    },
    "japanese_title": {
